0 dyno-direct (Brickwright Robot Lab validation machine, round 2)
0 Name: dyno-direct.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Brake dynamometer, direct (Robot Lab validation round 2): the SPIKE medium motor (port A) output up at the
0 // origin, a Technic beam 7 pinned under its housing (u0/u1). The white 24T slip-clutch gear 76019 sits on a 3L
0 // axle in the motor's output at y = -70 and meshes with a 24T 3648 on an 8L axle in the beam's hole at x = 60
0 // (pitch radii 30 + 30). The test holds that 24T's axle: the clutch's toothed ring stands, its hub turns with the
0 // motor and slips at the stamped torque - the motor works against a known constant torque.
